# system-details origin-error ----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# origin/main's report when any collector fails$
# (system_details_menu.go:42-62;$
# menu/system_details_error.golden): the error, twice, above the$
# box and in it, the box saying to check permissions whatever it$
# was, the report gone, Export not offered. The word "Error:"$
# before each title here is the component's, not origin/main's.$
$
# Operation Failed$
# Error retrieving system status: failed to collect memory info:$
# failed to get memory info: exec: "free": executable file not$
# found in $PATH$
$
# Error: System Details Error$
# Failed to retrieve system status information.$
# Error: failed to collect memory info: failed to get memory$
# info: exec: "free": executable file not found in $PATH$
# Please check system permissions and try again.$
$
# System Details ###############################################$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh Information  Reload system status from system$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

